		(property "Description" "PCF8574 8-bit I2C I/O expander module, address set by on-board A0-A2 jumpers (VentSense: 0x20, 0x21). A PCF8574A uses 0x38-0x3F instead. Drives LEDs sink-style: LED anode to +3V3 through 330 ohm, cathode to Pn. Pin order follows the common module; check it against the board we receive before wiring."
			(at 273.05 182.88 0)
			(hide yes)
